# Visual Studio / .NET Core
#############################
## Build results
bin/
obj/
out/

## User-specific files
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.sln.docstates

## Auto-generated Visual Studio files
.vs/
.vscode/
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb

## Rider
.idea/
*.iml
.idea/**/workspace.xml
.idea/**/tasks.xml
.idea/**/usage.statistics.xml

## NuGet
*.nupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of PackageReference restore
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
# NuGet v3 cache
.nuget/
# Uncomment if you deploy a local package source
# /local-packages/

## ASP.NET Core / wwwroot
wwwroot/lib/
wwwroot/node_modules/

## User-secret manager (if used)
secrets.json
# ASP.NET Core Secret Manager stores secrets in a user profile directory by default,
# so you usually don't need to ignore anything in the repo for it.

## EF Core Migrations (optional: keep or ignore migrations)
# Migrations are typically committed. If you want to ignore migration snapshots, add:
# **/Migrations/*.Snapshot.cs

## Logs and databases
*.log
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.db
*.mdf
*.ldf

